<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westvaco started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westvaco started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it started coverage of Westvaco Corp with a market outperformer rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/16 to 33-13/16.</p>
</text>
